          "changeMeaning": "Reveal the green resultant vector R stretching from the tail of A to the tip of B, showing the sum of the two vectors.",
          "narration": "The resultant is the single vector drawn from the tail of the first arrow to the tip of the last. This green vector R equals A plus B. It has the same effect as following both vectors in sequence."
